{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"想到对方时，他总想再多回味一会儿心里的甜，回味久了，想靠近的念头也收不住。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复回味\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想把喜欢留在心里，免得对方为难，也不想让期待牵着自己走。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"可越珍惜两人已有的亲近，就越常惦念对方，也越盼自己的关心能被对方领会。\",\n      \"key\": \"被对方领会\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍不肯催对方回应，只能自己带着没着落的盼望，眼前这样亲近的时刻也留不住。\",\n      \"key\": \"没着落的盼望\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得真心关心对方时有多快乐，舍不得少关心对方一点。\",\n      \"key\": \"有多快乐\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R28\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把喜欢不再轻巧、难以收放的变化落到反复回味、舍不得停下和想靠近的念头难以收住，解释B1的渴望加深与B2的沉醉快感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R29\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留把喜欢留在心里的初衷，以及免得对方为难、不让期待牵着自己走这两种动机，与R31所写的代价区分开。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R30\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留\",\n      \"why\": \"保留珍惜已有亲近、常常惦念对方、盼关心被领会之间的递进，不拆成重复条目。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R31\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不愿催促对方、只能独自带着期待的代价，并补出眼前的亲近也留不住的感受，使B3的时间流逝与无法停留有了具体的心理依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去抽象的价值判断，改为记得真心关心对方时的快乐，因此舍不得减少关心。跨段箭头同时保留S06-2中真实关切的理由，以及S06-3中独自想到对方时的甜意。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e5ca2e2e-0fc9-495d-9771-12905efe926e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T083050140721Z", "elapsed_seconds": 724.688, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T08:42:54.841931+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5add9ad2651ec9aeb549cd057d8cb2ee38173d7a58c694867b9951a0dd23f8be", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\